  "method": "Four independent model-driven reviewers, each given a disjoint slice of the catalog, each asked to name the vendor operation a tool maps to and to rate its own confidence. No vendor API was called: every package in the catalog is fixture-authored, so these verdicts rate the vendor OPERATION, never the name-to-operation binding at a live server. That binding is unproven for every package except the one the live leg touches.",
